# Blender
*.blend1
*.blend2

# The multilayer EXR passes vignette 5 writes next to the figures
docs/images/passes/

# Everything served from the documentation is WebP: it keeps a real alpha
# channel and the full colour range at a tenth of PNG's size on a path-traced
# image, and these figures are path-traced images. A stray PNG here is either
# something that escaped the pipeline or fifty megabytes of history nobody
# needs, so neither is committed.
docs/images/**/*.png

# The extensions.blender.org previews, which are PNG because the platform
# takes PNG and JPEG. Build output: `make listing` regenerates them at release
# time and they are uploaded rather than served.
docs/images/listing/

# Editors and OS
.DS_Store
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# APBS writes its MC-shell capture file into whatever directory it runs in.
io.mc
